sequenceDiagram
actor Retailer
actor Staff as "Admin/Operator"
participant UI as "Interface: UI"
participant API as "mainController: Controller"
participant Service as "complaintService: Service"
participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
Retailer->>UI: Select shipment, batch and disputed quantity
UI->>+API: POST /api/v1/complaints
API->>Service: validateShipmentOwnershipAndQuantity()
Service->>DB: Save complaint, evidence reference and disputed net value
API-->>-UI: Complaint Pending
Staff->>UI: Review complaint and decision
UI->>+API: POST /api/v1/complaints/{id}/resolve
API->>Service: resolveComplaint(decision, reason)
Service->>DB: Approve adjustment or restore disputed amount
DB-->>API: Complaint resolved
API-->>-UI: Resolution result

